OL,3,CProgramme listings for MON 19 JAN
OL,4,G1300FClassical Live
OL,5,     GLinton Stephens showcases the
OL,6,     Gbest performances from the UK and
OL,7,     Gbeyond, including a live concert
OL,8,     Gfrom renowned Baroque vocal group
OL,9,     GVox Luminis in Wigmore Hall in
OL,10,     GLondon.
OL,11,G1600FComposer of the Week: Dvorak
OL,12,     GKate Molleson explores the life
OL,13,     Gand loves of Antonin Dvorak.
OL,14,     GToday, one of the guiding forces
OL,15,     Gin everything he did and created
OL,16,     G- his nearest and dearest.
OL,17,G1700FIn Tune
OL,18,     GPetroc Trelawny is joined by bass-
OL,19,     Gbaritone Gerald Finley ahead of
OL,20,     Ghis performance with the LSO, and
OL,21,     Gpianist Samson Tsoy performs live
OL,22,     Gin the studio.
